21:11.810 --> 21:18.130
I only did... what I had to!

21:18.130 --> 21:20.150
Quit crying!

21:20.150 --> 21:22.760
Just come back and work 
for us for cheap again.

21:22.760 --> 21:23.710
That'll be enough!

21:23.710 --> 21:24.610
I will!

